    {
      "text": "depart from me, ye that work iniquity, Matt. 7:23 (3 Ne. 14:23). give account thereof in the day of judgment, Matt. 12:36. he shall reward every man according to his works, Matt. 16:27. sit upon twelve thrones, judging the twelve tribes, Matt. 19:28 (Luke 22:30; 1 Ne. 12:9–10). he shall separate them one from another, Matt. 25:32. Father … hath committed all judgment unto the Son, John 5:22. word that I have spoken … shall judge him, John 12:48. he will judge the world in righteousness, Acts 17:31. judgment of God is according to truth, Rom. 2:2. that thou shalt escape the judgment of God, Rom. 2:3. all stand before the judgment seat of Christ, Rom. 14:10. saints shall judge the world, 1 Cor. 6:2. judged according to men in the flesh, 1 Pet. 4:6 (D&C 88:99; 138:34). chains of darkness, to be reserved unto judgment, 2 Pet. 2:4. love made perfect, that we may have boldness in the day of judgment, 1 Jn. 4:17. under darkness unto the judgment of the great day, Jude 1:6. the hour of his judgment is come, Rev. 14:7. dead were judged out of those things which were written, Rev. 20:12.",
